		"description": "Complete form component: one Zod schema validates, the mutation writes, a failure lands back on the field and success refreshes the list. Requires @tanstack/vue-query, vee-validate, @vee-validate/zod, zod and a request function of your own.\n\n完整的表单组件：一份 Zod schema 负责校验，mutation 负责写入，失败回落到字段上、成功后刷新列表；需要 @tanstack/vue-query、vee-validate、@vee-validate/zod、zod，以及自建的请求函数。",
